# 1 Carat Radiant Cut Diamond Ring: The G-VS2 Wall

Most buyers arrive at 1ct through research. They've compared 0.75ct to 1.5ct, decided 1ct is the right balance of size and budget, and now want to know what grades and settings to choose at exactly this weight.

At 1ct specifically, the radiant cut has a grade threshold that separates defensible buying from invisible overspend. That threshold is G-VS2. This post explains why, what 1ct looks like on the finger, and what a complete ring costs across every setting style and metal — with certified market data throughout.

Every price is stone plus setting. Every table has a "What this means" column.

**TL;DR:**
- 1 carat radiant cut diamond rings start at [$1,727 lab](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/ten-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-311235?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) or [$3,178 natural](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/25995245?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)
- → Best lab: [1ct D-VVS1 IGI $932](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/24946874?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) + [Ten Prong WG $860](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/ten-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-311235?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = **$1,792**
- → Best natural: [1ct G-VS2 GIA $2,318](https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/25995245?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) + [Ten Prong WG $860](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/ten-prong-solitaire-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-311235?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational) = **$3,178**
- G-VS2 Wall: below G, tint shows in white metal; below VS2, inclusions risk visibility at 1ct
- A 1ct radiant averages 5.5–6.5mm face-up — enough mass to anchor a solitaire without a halo
- Lab saves $1,386+ vs natural at equivalent grade with identical visual performance

